# The project is LF throughout and the tooling writes LF. Without this, Git on
# Windows rewrites every file on checkout and every diff is noise.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary provenance: model packs, saved reference pages and committed sources.
# `* text=auto` guesses correctly for most of these; saying so explicitly keeps
# a stray diff out of the log when the guess is close.
*.glb binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary

# The website's pictures and clips live in Git LFS (owner's choice, 2 October):
# about 40 MB that every retake would otherwise add to the history again,
# permanently. The pages themselves are ordinary text. Media committed before
# this line (the first, low-resolution set) stays in the history as it was.
site/media/** filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
